{"v":4,"catch":"擊敗復活的GORDESS！","desc":"《FINAL STAR FORCE》是TECMO於1992年發行的射擊遊戲。\n前作兩千多年後，你將與復活的宿敵 GORDESS 進行最後的戰鬥。\n你的飛船 Final Star II 將隨著時間的推移逐漸增強。將其強化到最大，以獲得無與倫比的力量！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2025-01-23","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6b03b363ae5498c635660e9fcbfceea0f049044c5f76aedbc46592a7ad2fdbbd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/901e3510bb5e1aa10fbccf23219c0b68ad906bb12422adfd59d7fb746b891af3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9506364bbaa8a9d1bf16cf534badf7993e11f0276e1732d6d3541c58d4fb095a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/89819d717c5c1db6e6ffb29808c84cd836c8ca58fc188cf685f17fcd8b69a8b7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1ec9001654cbe591a40c57d6255b5cfc5ffbe668e48ec1b8584d5ec921f4c6e6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/854a3c03bb67f5cfa85fb91b4deda04c5f678d12463b90622d859d58f127806b.jpg"],"titleId":"01005fc01dbe6000","dlc":[]}